The '''lurca kennels'''<ref name="Shadows">{{TBB|Shadows of Tantiss}}</ref> were where several [[lurca hound]]s were kept inside of the [[Galactic Empire]]'s [[Tantiss Base]]. The space included several kennels where lurca hounds were individually kept. Each kennel had straw inside and a tunnel that allowed the hounds to be deployed outside the base. When the young [[Cloning|clone]] [[Omega]] was kept [[prisoner]] at Tantiss Base, she was made to feed the lurca hounds, eventually bonding with the lurca hound she dubbed "[[Batcher]]."<ref name="Confined" />

